Ben: Haha, yes! And I used to be very quiet too. I never said a word in class.
Anna: I remember! Now you''re tall and you talk to everyone. What changed?
Ben: I joined the school basketball team. It made me taller and gave me confidence. What about you? You used to have long hair.
Anna: I cut it last year. And I didn''t use to like reading, but now I read a book every week.
Ben: People really change in a few years, don''t they?
Anna: They do. It''s nice to see how far we''ve both come.', '对话', 115, '[{"q": "What did Ben use to be like?", "answer": "A", "options": ["Short and quiet.", "Funny and active.", "Tall and loud.", "Lazy and shy."], "explanation": "原文:used to be really short… used to be very quiet"}, {"q": "What helped Ben change?", "answer": "D", "options": ["Moving to a new city.", "Cutting his hair.", "Reading many books.", "Joining the basketball team."], "explanation": "原文:I joined the school basketball team"}, {"q": "What did Anna use to have?", "answer": "A", "options": ["Long hair.", "Glasses.", "A basketball.", "Short hair."], "explanation": "原文:You used to have long hair"}, {"q": "What does Anna do now that she didn''t use to do?", "answer": "C", "options": ["Stay quiet in class.", "Play basketball.", "Read a book every week.", "Cut others'' hair."], "explanation": "原文:didn''t use to like reading, but now I read a book every week"}, {"q": "What do both speakers agree on?", "answer": "A", "options": ["People really change over the years.", "Reading is hard.", "School is boring.", "Sports are useless."], "explanation": "推断:结尾都同意 people really change"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 3, '9', 'U4');

